  m_Name: RepeatedLightsInteractionOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: RepeatedLightsInteractionOne
  dialogueLines:
  - You really seem to enjoy playing around with those lights, I guess
  - Well, I suppose the lights are keeping you entertained somehow
  - "You\u2019ve taken quite an interest in the lighting situation, haven\u2019t
    you"
  - "I didn\u2019t realize flicking lights on and off was going to be your new hobby"
  - "You really can\u2019t seem to leave those lights alone, can you"
  - "I guess messing with the lights is what we\u2019re doing now"
  - "Of all the things in here, you\u2019ve become fascinated with the light switches"
  - "You\u2019re getting a surprising amount of entertainment out of those lights"
  - I see. The lights have captured your attention again
  - "Well, if playing with the lights makes you happy, I suppose I can\u2019t stop
    you"
  canRepeat: 0
  priority: 1
